# GENERAL RESULTS FOR IMRI CASES  (Cutler-Vallisneri / LM-damped CV)
# nchannels=3 (A,E,T), include_noise=False, chi2(secondary spin)=0.95
# param_names (9-param / 0PA):  [m1, m2, a, p0, e0, qS, phiS, Phi_phi0, Phi_r0]
# param_names (11-param / dev): [m1, m2, a, p0, e0, qS, phiS, Phi_phi0, Phi_r0, dev_1, dev_2]
# chi2 = <r|r> in this pipeline (always POSITIVE); relates to overlap by chi2 ~ 2*SNR^2*(1-overlap).
# NOTE: dt differs between blocks - it is stated per case. The a x e0 grid metadata specifies dt=10.
# Deviations: PN = C_p/C_e (additive 2.5PN pdot/edot); simple = del_0_p/del_0_e (mult. Edot/Ldot); hybrid branch.

